WEBVTT

02:11.960 --> 02:13.400
STRONG BLEACHING POWDER

02:49.480 --> 02:50.400
Qiao.

02:52.240 --> 02:55.560
The real owner of this house
is you, isn't it?

03:09.000 --> 03:10.920
Mr. He, you're confused.

03:11.760 --> 03:13.440
This was my former employer's house.

03:14.080 --> 03:15.640
I only lived here before.

03:16.160 --> 03:17.760
How could I be the owner?

03:18.360 --> 03:20.640
Then who was your former employer?

03:22.080 --> 03:24.280
Many people in Yuanlongli know that.

03:24.360 --> 03:26.440
I'm asking about the real employer.

03:26.960 --> 03:29.200
The son of Yao Baiyuan,

03:30.440 --> 03:31.600
Yao Xincheng.

03:42.440 --> 03:46.520
You should know
who I'm talking about, right?

03:47.720 --> 03:49.400
In 1996,

03:49.480 --> 03:52.880
Yao Xincheng bought this apartment
under the name of Yao Baiyuan.

03:54.080 --> 03:55.320
In 2002,

03:55.840 --> 03:57.320
he asked you to sell it.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.280
Then in 2003,

03:59.360 --> 04:01.480
you used Yao Xincheng's name

04:02.000 --> 04:04.000
to buy it back again,

04:05.080 --> 04:06.960
but it was never transferred.

04:08.200 --> 04:09.160
Why?

04:09.680 --> 04:11.840
Because you didn't want
your own name to appear

04:11.920 --> 04:13.360
on the owner's list.

04:14.200 --> 04:15.640
You smashed this place up

04:15.720 --> 04:18.360
and left it vacant for 12 years.

04:18.880 --> 04:20.680
You were worried
that if anyone else lived here,

04:20.760 --> 04:22.320
you'd never feel at ease.

04:22.960 --> 04:23.960
Am I right?

04:24.880 --> 04:25.760
Yes.

04:28.320 --> 04:29.480
I'll never be at ease.

04:30.600 --> 04:31.800
In this apartment,

04:33.160 --> 04:35.040
Yao Baiyuan abused me.

04:35.120 --> 04:37.560
Wu Shanlong peeped at me.

04:38.360 --> 04:40.000
I hate this place to my core.

04:40.080 --> 04:41.560
I wanted to vent.

04:41.640 --> 04:43.400
I wanted to destroy it.

04:44.840 --> 04:46.760
-Is that wrong?
-You can hate people,

04:47.280 --> 04:48.560
but you can't kill them.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.480
Qiao Suqing,

05:00.000 --> 05:01.880
you are suspected of intentional murder

05:01.960 --> 05:04.480
in accordance with Article 117

05:04.560 --> 05:06.280
of the Criminal Procedure Law
of the People's Republic of China.

05:06.960 --> 05:09.160
Please come with us to the police station
for questioning.

05:09.240 --> 05:10.760
SUMMONS

05:12.080 --> 05:13.240
Who did I kill?

05:13.320 --> 05:15.120
You are suspected
of kidnapping and murdering

05:15.200 --> 05:17.320
Xu Zhihong and Xu Meng.

05:28.520 --> 05:33.760
DEMOLITION

06:28.800 --> 06:29.960
Xiaohe,

06:30.640 --> 06:33.040
I didn't expect
you'd be the one questioning me.

06:33.720 --> 06:34.680
I thought

06:35.480 --> 06:37.240
you should've recused yourself,

06:37.760 --> 06:38.800
considering how well we know each other.

06:49.160 --> 06:50.040
Qiao Suqing,

06:50.800 --> 06:51.680
listen carefully.

06:52.520 --> 06:54.840
In this room,
there is only one relationship

06:54.920 --> 06:55.880
between two people sitting face to face.

06:56.480 --> 06:58.160
That is a police officer
and a criminal suspect.

06:59.000 --> 07:01.480
And a suspect has only one way
to address an officer.

07:01.560 --> 07:03.280
That is Officer.

07:04.240 --> 07:05.120
Alright.

07:05.720 --> 07:06.760
Officer He.

07:08.400 --> 07:09.480
Qiao Suqing,

07:10.400 --> 07:12.000
now tell the truth.

07:12.080 --> 07:13.760
How did you kill Xu Meng and her father?

07:15.720 --> 07:16.800
Officer He,

07:17.680 --> 07:19.280
I've never harmed anyone,

07:19.360 --> 07:20.760
let alone killed anyone.

07:21.960 --> 07:25.720
I don't know why Mr. He
and you would suspect me.

07:27.680 --> 07:29.080
If not for this evidence,

07:29.680 --> 07:30.640
I wouldn't believe

07:30.720 --> 07:32.640
that the Qiao Suqing
sitting in front of me

07:32.720 --> 07:33.800
would be suspected of murder.

07:35.080 --> 07:36.320
But evidence is evidence.

07:37.760 --> 07:39.000
It doesn't lie,

07:39.720 --> 07:42.080
much less deceive people on purpose
for all these years.

07:43.920 --> 07:45.040
Officer He,

07:46.200 --> 07:48.640
I don't know what evidence you have,

07:50.400 --> 07:52.000
but there must be some misunderstanding.

07:54.720 --> 07:56.160
Since you say there's a misunderstanding,

07:57.400 --> 07:58.880
then cooperate with us

07:59.400 --> 08:01.120
and answer my questions truthfully.

08:05.600 --> 08:06.680
Ask away.

08:07.920 --> 08:10.160
While you lived
in No. 415 at New York Block,

08:10.840 --> 08:12.360
was your home ever burglarized?

08:14.240 --> 08:17.520
-No.
-Are you sure nothing was stolen?

08:18.880 --> 08:19.720
I am.

08:25.640 --> 08:26.840
Do you know Yao Xincheng?

08:26.920 --> 08:28.400
Yes.

08:28.480 --> 08:30.560
On December 29th, 1996,

08:30.640 --> 08:32.960
did Yao Xincheng give you this dress?

08:39.360 --> 08:40.720
I don't remember.

08:41.240 --> 08:43.880
Did Mr. Yao tell you

08:43.960 --> 08:45.520
he gave me that dress?

08:45.600 --> 08:47.160
Answer my question.

08:50.200 --> 08:52.040
If Mr. Yao said he gave it,

08:52.120 --> 08:53.560
then I suppose he did.

08:54.320 --> 08:56.760
To make up for what his father did to me,

08:57.720 --> 08:59.480
he gave me many clothes.

09:01.560 --> 09:03.120
But I never wore a single one.

09:04.680 --> 09:05.760
Putting them on

09:06.560 --> 09:10.360
would only remind me
of what his father did to me.

09:10.960 --> 09:13.080
Why was the dress Yao Xincheng gave you

09:13.160 --> 09:14.760
hanging in Xu Meng's home?

09:17.560 --> 09:20.800
That dress was a classic style
from the Bowls.

09:21.320 --> 09:23.280
A lot of people bought it back then.

09:23.360 --> 09:25.160
How can you prove

09:25.240 --> 09:29.080
the one in Xu Meng's house
was the one he gave me?

09:29.160 --> 09:31.400
Every question I ask is well-founded.

09:31.480 --> 09:33.440
You only need to answer truthfully.

09:34.200 --> 09:36.520
Why did the dress Yao Xincheng gave you

09:37.120 --> 09:39.520
appear in Xu Meng's house?

09:44.720 --> 09:45.760
Officer He,

09:46.360 --> 09:48.120
my house was never robbed.

09:49.000 --> 09:51.120
Any clothes Yao Xincheng gave me,

09:51.720 --> 09:54.280
I took them
to the wholesale clothing market

09:54.360 --> 09:56.240
and sold them cheaply
to small shop owners.

09:56.840 --> 09:59.760
As for who they resold them to,

10:00.800 --> 10:02.360
I wouldn't know.

10:06.320 --> 10:07.520
Qiao Suqing,

10:07.600 --> 10:10.240
on July 2nd, 1997, where were you?

10:12.200 --> 10:13.160
I don't remember.

10:14.120 --> 10:15.640
All I remember

10:16.320 --> 10:18.680
is that during that time,
I stayed home every day studying

10:18.760 --> 10:20.120
and preparing for the Adult Gaokao.

10:23.800 --> 10:26.640
Officer He, you came to my house then.

10:34.560 --> 10:37.840
You asked me what the Adult Gaokao was.

10:43.440 --> 10:45.400
We promised each other

10:50.280 --> 10:51.760
we'd both become top students.

10:51.840 --> 10:54.000
Qiao Suqing, don't dodge the question.

10:55.080 --> 10:55.960
Sorry.

10:57.760 --> 10:59.960
Maybe too much time has passed.

11:03.520 --> 11:05.480
I can only remember the good memories.

11:06.120 --> 11:08.760
Dad, I really like Ms. Qiao.

11:08.840 --> 11:11.600
Can you ask Uncle Ran
to bring me here often?

11:11.680 --> 11:13.160
From the first time I met you,

11:13.240 --> 11:14.840
I felt like you'd become family.

11:27.600 --> 11:28.920
Since you said

11:29.480 --> 11:31.680
you hated remembering
the harm Yao Baiyuan did to you

11:31.760 --> 11:34.160
and you refused to wear
the clothes Yao Xincheng bought you,

11:34.680 --> 11:36.760
then why did you stay
in their apartment for so many years

11:36.840 --> 11:37.920
after Yao Baiyuan died,

11:38.520 --> 11:40.360
even when people called you a mistress?

11:41.000 --> 11:42.160
I had no choice.

11:43.320 --> 11:45.080
I had nowhere to go.

11:45.160 --> 11:47.880
If I hadn't stayed there,
I would've ended up on the streets.

11:49.240 --> 11:50.360
More than my dignity,

11:51.520 --> 11:53.160
I needed to survive.

12:02.520 --> 12:05.080
Do you recognize this pair of heels?

12:17.360 --> 12:18.360
No.

12:19.880 --> 12:21.840
They appear to be a pair of blue heels.

12:23.840 --> 12:25.720
But they were covered in blue leather.

12:25.800 --> 12:29.160
They were supposed to be red heels.

12:32.400 --> 12:33.520
Now that I've said this much,

12:34.080 --> 12:35.720
you should recognize it.

12:39.320 --> 12:40.160
Fine.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.480
If you don't know the heels,

12:42.560 --> 12:45.360
there's someone you definitely know.

12:53.080 --> 12:54.640
My name is Zhu Ziqiang.

12:54.720 --> 12:57.560
I used to work
as Mr. Yao Xincheng's driver.

12:57.640 --> 12:59.640
In the summer of 2002,

13:00.280 --> 13:01.480
Qiao Suqing came to me.

13:02.160 --> 13:05.000
She gave me a pair
of Double Fish brand red heels

13:05.080 --> 13:06.240
and 2,000 yuan.

13:06.760 --> 13:09.360
She told me to go to a place
called Pingzhao County

13:09.440 --> 13:12.480
and find a shoemaker named Mr. Lu.

13:14.160 --> 13:17.480
She wanted me to have those red heels
covered with blue leather.

13:18.080 --> 13:19.960
Qiao Suqing specifically warned me

13:20.040 --> 13:21.480
that when I went to see Mr. Lu,

13:21.560 --> 13:23.120
I had to cover myself up completely.

13:23.200 --> 13:25.560
Wear a hat or sunglasses.

13:29.440 --> 13:30.440
Qiao Suqing,

13:30.520 --> 13:31.960
why did you do that?

13:32.040 --> 13:35.000
And why were those altered heels
found in Wu Shanlong's home?

13:36.640 --> 13:38.640
You can tell us now

13:38.720 --> 13:41.000
how you killed Xu Meng and her father

13:42.040 --> 13:43.080
and framed Wu Shanlong.

13:49.480 --> 13:51.000
I did ask Yao Xincheng's driver

13:54.120 --> 13:56.920
to have the red heels altered.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.920
But later, Wu Shanlong stole them.

14:00.000 --> 14:01.720
He had a fetish.

14:01.800 --> 14:03.600
He stole women's clothes
from the building.

14:03.680 --> 14:05.680
I asked you that in my first question.

14:06.400 --> 14:08.760
You said nothing
had been stolen from your home.

14:09.280 --> 14:10.200
Can't I forget something?

14:11.320 --> 14:13.960
Can a pair of heels prove I'm a murderer?

14:14.040 --> 14:16.800
I… I don't even know
Xu Meng and her father.

14:16.880 --> 14:19.000
I had nothing to do with them.

14:19.080 --> 14:20.920
Why… Why would I kill them?

14:27.080 --> 14:28.880
Who is Fang Xiuhong to you?

14:31.280 --> 14:32.240
Qiao Suqing,

14:32.760 --> 14:34.280
answer my question.

14:35.160 --> 14:36.520
Who is Fang Xiuhong to you?

14:44.240 --> 14:45.280
She was my mother.

14:46.320 --> 14:49.000
She was one of the victims
of the August 24th Mount Wu Accident.

14:49.560 --> 14:50.600
Right?

14:56.240 --> 14:57.480
XU ZHIHONG, XU MENG

15:01.680 --> 15:04.880
FANG XIUHONG, QIAO SUQING

15:06.320 --> 15:07.680
Xu Meng and Xu Zhihong

15:07.760 --> 15:09.760
were among the victims
of that accident too.

15:09.840 --> 15:11.480
Yet you claimed
you had nothing to do with them?

15:11.560 --> 15:12.920
Xu Meng deserved to die!

15:13.960 --> 15:15.200
She deserved it!

15:27.560 --> 15:30.880
In August 1995, my mother and I

15:31.840 --> 15:33.800
signed up for a tour group.

15:34.400 --> 15:37.200
Alright, everyone. Let's do a roll call.

15:38.880 --> 15:40.320
-Wang Zusheng.
-Here.

15:40.920 --> 15:42.240
-Qiao Suqing.
-Here.

15:43.560 --> 15:44.720
Fang Xiuhong.

15:45.240 --> 15:46.160
Here.

15:46.240 --> 15:48.680
-Xu Zhihong.
-Over here.

15:49.440 --> 15:52.200
-Xu Meng.
-Here.

15:52.280 --> 15:53.800
Be careful.

15:58.000 --> 15:59.120
Stay close together.

16:03.280 --> 16:05.160
You can slow down a little.

16:06.440 --> 16:08.600
Well. Everyone in the back, keep up.

16:09.200 --> 16:10.800
Steady yourselves.

16:10.880 --> 16:12.680
Hold on to the rope beside you.

16:12.760 --> 16:13.760
Be careful.

16:13.840 --> 16:15.840
Those taking photos,
once you're done, catch up quickly.

16:15.920 --> 16:17.760
Meng, move this way a bit.

16:17.840 --> 16:18.680
Closer this way.

16:18.760 --> 16:19.720
Yes.

16:22.040 --> 16:22.880
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

16:22.960 --> 16:24.280
Your cap.

16:41.440 --> 16:42.520
Everyone,

16:43.040 --> 16:44.560
watch your footing.

16:44.640 --> 16:45.800
The trail is slippery.

16:45.880 --> 16:47.760
Be mindful of both sides.

16:47.840 --> 16:49.520
Mount Wu not only has beautiful scenery,

16:50.120 --> 16:52.800
but also over a hundred species of plants.

16:54.080 --> 16:55.280
I tripped.

16:55.360 --> 16:56.480
-Are you alright?
-Be careful.

16:57.520 --> 16:59.040
Why is the fog so thick?

16:59.120 --> 17:00.280
We can't even see the road.

17:00.360 --> 17:02.000
Exactly. My wife fell.

17:02.080 --> 17:03.880
Everyone, don't panic.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.960
This kind of weather
is very common on Mount Wu.

17:06.040 --> 17:08.400
The heavy fog will clear soon.

17:08.480 --> 17:10.880
How about this?
Hold hands with people around you.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.480
Don't get separated.

17:12.560 --> 17:14.079
Follow me. Alright?

17:14.160 --> 17:14.760
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

17:16.280 --> 17:17.400
-Hang in there.
-Take it slow.

17:17.480 --> 17:18.599
Walk slowly.

17:23.560 --> 17:24.440
Walk slowly.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.200
I…

17:27.720 --> 17:30.600
-I can't breathe.
-Come.

17:30.680 --> 17:32.520
Rest here for a bit.

17:32.600 --> 17:33.680
Sit down.

17:41.000 --> 17:42.480
Why are you sitting down?

17:42.560 --> 17:44.440
Hurry up. Don't hold us back.

17:44.520 --> 17:45.520
I can't walk anymore.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.080
You see,

17:48.160 --> 17:49.640
we really can't stay here.

17:49.720 --> 17:51.160
It'll be dark soon.

17:51.240 --> 17:52.200
We'll freeze to death if we stay here.

17:52.280 --> 17:55.280
Can't you be considerate
and wait a little?

17:55.360 --> 17:57.040
You can't drag us down with you.

17:57.120 --> 17:58.800
Why bother with them? Let's just go.

17:58.880 --> 18:00.520
-Go.
-Let's leave.

18:01.640 --> 18:03.640
You rest a bit. Catch up quickly.

18:09.280 --> 18:10.200
Qing.

18:10.280 --> 18:11.360
Qing.

18:11.440 --> 18:12.520
Qing.

18:12.600 --> 18:13.680
Qing.

18:13.760 --> 18:14.800
Qing.

18:25.080 --> 18:25.920
Mom.

18:28.960 --> 18:29.840
Mom.

18:30.600 --> 18:31.760
Mom.

18:37.440 --> 18:39.200
-Excuse me. Where's my mom?
-Don't… Don't come near us.

18:42.960 --> 18:43.800
I'm warning you.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.240
Don't…

18:45.320 --> 18:46.560
Don't try anything.

18:46.640 --> 18:48.400
What are you talking about?

18:48.480 --> 18:50.520
Where… Where's my mom?

18:51.160 --> 18:52.720
You're worse than an animal!

18:53.240 --> 18:54.480
You have no conscience!

18:55.400 --> 18:57.080
You… What are you talking about?

18:57.160 --> 18:59.120
I'm just asking where my mom is.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.720
Stop pretending.

19:01.240 --> 19:03.680
Before you passed out, you went crazy

19:03.760 --> 19:05.520
trying to tear the clothes
off my dad and me.

19:05.600 --> 19:06.360
We refused,

19:06.440 --> 19:08.320
and you nearly pushed my dad
off the cliff.

19:08.400 --> 19:10.080
His leg was broken.

19:10.160 --> 19:11.080
Then…

19:11.160 --> 19:13.200
Then you went to grab your mom's clothes.

19:13.280 --> 19:14.920
Your mom was frozen stiff.

19:15.000 --> 19:16.280
She wouldn't give them to you,

19:16.360 --> 19:18.120
and you pushed her off the cliff.

19:21.640 --> 19:22.960
No. That can't be true.

19:32.640 --> 19:33.640
Mom!

19:34.840 --> 19:35.680
Mom!

19:37.800 --> 19:39.040
Where are you, Mom?

19:39.120 --> 19:40.400
Mom!

19:41.000 --> 19:42.000
Mom!

19:43.680 --> 19:44.640
Mom!

19:55.280 --> 19:57.360
I passed out from the cold again

19:59.400 --> 20:00.480
at the bottom of the cliff.

20:02.720 --> 20:04.640
When I woke up,

20:05.160 --> 20:07.240
I found myself in the rescue vehicle.

20:09.040 --> 20:10.720
They found my mother's body

20:11.600 --> 20:13.200
at the bottom of the cliff.

20:33.960 --> 20:35.200
After the incident,

20:36.760 --> 20:38.320
my aunt took me in.

20:40.000 --> 20:43.840
I ate, lived, and worked

20:45.400 --> 20:46.480
at her restaurant.

20:47.200 --> 20:48.920
We got along well at first.

20:50.880 --> 20:53.440
But after the compensation money came in,

20:55.720 --> 20:56.960
everything changed.

20:57.920 --> 21:01.200
You jinx! Are you blind?

21:01.920 --> 21:03.240
There, there. Don't cry.

21:03.320 --> 21:04.400
You killed my sister,
and that still wasn't enough?

21:05.280 --> 21:06.560
Stay away from my granddaughter.

21:06.640 --> 21:08.040
Rotten luck.

21:08.120 --> 21:09.280
Meeting you was the worst thing
that ever happened to me.

21:15.960 --> 21:17.560
Qing, are you tired?

21:19.880 --> 21:21.360
Look at you. Your clothes are soaked.

21:21.440 --> 21:22.280
I'll help you change.

21:22.360 --> 21:23.400
You might catch a cold.

21:23.480 --> 21:24.480
Catching a cold is serious.

21:24.560 --> 21:25.840
Hurry up.

21:25.920 --> 21:26.800
You shameless flirt.

21:26.880 --> 21:29.440
I'll beat you to death. You witch!

21:29.520 --> 21:31.240
Shameless flirt! Shameless!

21:31.320 --> 21:32.360
Trash!

21:32.440 --> 21:33.240
Flirt!

21:33.320 --> 21:35.080
Witch! Witch!

21:41.640 --> 21:43.040
Qing, come here.

21:43.120 --> 21:44.240
Leave the dishes for now.

21:44.320 --> 21:46.240
Come. I have something to tell you.

21:46.320 --> 21:47.600
Great news.

21:48.680 --> 21:49.640
You've worked hard.

21:50.680 --> 21:52.800
I've found you a good place.

21:57.640 --> 21:59.720
She said she found me a good place,

21:59.800 --> 22:01.400
but really, she took someone's money

22:03.520 --> 22:05.320
and sold me away to be
a servant in another town.

22:08.480 --> 22:11.120
When I first met Yao Xincheng,

22:13.920 --> 22:15.200
I thought

22:16.080 --> 22:18.800
he looked like
a refined and successful man.

22:24.560 --> 22:25.800
I thought to myself,

22:26.480 --> 22:28.160
my luck wasn't that bad after all.

22:28.760 --> 22:30.720
Serving someone like him

22:31.920 --> 22:36.000
had to be a thousand times better
than staying at my aunt's home.

22:39.120 --> 22:40.080
NEW YORK BLOCK

22:45.840 --> 22:47.640
But I was completely wrong.

22:52.720 --> 22:54.640
Yao Xincheng brought me to Yuanlongli

22:55.600 --> 22:57.480
to look after his father.

23:19.360 --> 23:21.800
From the day I met Yao Baiyuan,

23:22.320 --> 23:23.640
I finally understood

23:24.160 --> 23:27.040
what a true living hell was.

23:39.160 --> 23:41.440
NEW YORK BLOCK

23:41.520 --> 23:42.360
Mr. Yao,

23:42.440 --> 23:44.840
I really can't do this anymore.

23:46.320 --> 23:47.680
I'll find a way to pay back

23:47.760 --> 23:49.960
however much you paid my aunt.

23:57.080 --> 23:59.080
-Wait outside.
-Alright.

24:05.760 --> 24:06.760
Qiao,

24:06.840 --> 24:09.160
I apologize on behalf of my dad.

24:10.040 --> 24:11.240
Given his current condition,

24:11.320 --> 24:12.920
I really can't find anyone else.

24:13.000 --> 24:14.400
I can raise your pay.

24:14.480 --> 24:16.320
As much as you want. Is that alright?

24:22.240 --> 24:23.600
I went to Weiyang Mall earlier today

24:23.680 --> 24:24.760
and picked out some gifts for you.

24:24.840 --> 24:26.040
Here. Take it.

24:26.120 --> 24:29.040
Mr. Yao, I really can't do this anymore.

24:40.880 --> 24:41.760
Five years.

24:42.480 --> 24:44.440
If you can take care of my dad
for five full years,

24:45.280 --> 24:47.000
I'll transfer the apartment to you.

24:47.800 --> 24:48.640
Alright?

24:49.520 --> 24:53.120
Don't you want
a home of your own in Weiyang?

24:56.360 --> 24:57.880
A home of my own…

24:58.760 --> 25:00.880
That offer was too tempting.

25:03.280 --> 25:04.120
I was moved.

25:05.920 --> 25:07.560
So I forced myself

25:08.800 --> 25:09.880
to endure it

25:10.560 --> 25:11.520
and suffer through it.

25:13.080 --> 25:15.000
That's how I lasted a whole year.

25:17.120 --> 25:20.080
Maybe Heaven pitied me.

25:21.160 --> 25:22.760
At the end of 1996,

25:23.360 --> 25:26.280
Yao Baiyuan went up
to the 18th floor at night

25:26.360 --> 25:28.960
to peep at the Pattia staff

25:30.720 --> 25:32.280
and fell to his death.

25:34.120 --> 25:36.520
Qian Dajun knows everything about that.

25:37.480 --> 25:38.920
Yao Xincheng

25:39.560 --> 25:41.160
was a wealthy businessman
from another province.

25:41.720 --> 25:43.320
He was in overseas trade.

25:43.920 --> 25:46.560
His father was Yao Baiyuan.

25:46.640 --> 25:49.480
He had a strange illness.
He couldn't stand daylight.

25:49.560 --> 25:51.120
No one could cure it.

25:51.200 --> 25:53.000
In 1995,

25:53.080 --> 25:54.920
he came to Weiyang for business

25:55.000 --> 25:58.520
and heard that the Qihuang Clinic
in our building

25:58.600 --> 26:00.160
specialized in rare illnesses.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.960
To make treatment easier,

26:02.040 --> 26:03.200
Yao Xincheng

26:04.240 --> 26:07.120
bought an apartment at New York Block
under Yao Baiyuan's name.

26:07.200 --> 26:09.000
He hired a maid.

26:09.760 --> 26:10.840
You don't know this,

26:10.920 --> 26:12.840
but Yao Baiyuan was a pervert.

26:13.560 --> 26:17.000
He had ways and means
to torment those young maids.

26:17.080 --> 26:17.880
Be serious.

26:19.360 --> 26:20.280
Alright.

26:20.880 --> 26:23.760
Well, no maid could put up with it.

26:23.840 --> 26:24.880
None of them lasted long.

26:24.960 --> 26:26.760
He was changing maids every week or two.

26:26.840 --> 26:28.160
In the end,

26:28.240 --> 26:31.160
every maid in Weiyang
refused to work for him.

26:31.920 --> 26:33.960
Yao Xincheng could only

26:34.040 --> 26:36.680
pay high prices to hire
a maid from another town.

26:37.920 --> 26:41.320
How did Yao Baiyuan die?

26:42.520 --> 26:44.960
That pervert got himself killed.

26:45.560 --> 26:47.120
He ran to the 18th floor to Pattia

26:47.200 --> 26:48.960
to peep at the girls changing.

27:29.680 --> 27:31.000
Help! Help!

27:51.080 --> 27:53.960
Does Yao Baiyuan's death
have anything to do with Qiao Suqing?

27:54.960 --> 27:56.120
Probably not.

27:57.160 --> 27:58.920
The police came too.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.240
His death was ruled accidental.

28:00.320 --> 28:02.160
Besides, whenever he went out,

28:02.240 --> 28:03.760
he always locked Qiao Suqing inside.

28:04.720 --> 28:06.040
After that accident,

28:06.120 --> 28:08.200
Yao Xincheng returned from overseas.

28:08.280 --> 28:10.880
It wasn't until after he dealt
with the funeral arrangements

28:10.960 --> 28:13.880
that he remembered
someone was still locked inside No. 415.

28:21.160 --> 28:22.200
Give me a hand.

28:45.480 --> 28:47.320
Mr. Yao was a filial son.

28:47.840 --> 28:49.560
He wanted to earn virtue for his father.

28:50.280 --> 28:53.680
So he kept his promise
and transferred that apartment to me.

28:54.400 --> 28:57.080
It was just that
he held foreign citizenship,

28:57.680 --> 28:59.720
and the inheritance procedures
were complicated.

28:59.800 --> 29:02.200
So he let me live there first

29:02.720 --> 29:06.360
and said he'd handle the paperwork
the next time he came back.

29:07.480 --> 29:09.280
I lived there for five years.

29:11.440 --> 29:12.560
By

29:14.360 --> 29:15.760
the winter of 2002,

29:15.840 --> 29:17.880
he still didn't have time to come back.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.960
I started pressing him about it.

29:21.240 --> 29:23.160
So he mailed me all the documents

29:23.240 --> 29:24.240
and told me to handle it for him.

29:24.320 --> 29:27.920
But by then, I wanted
to leave that apartment.

29:29.120 --> 29:30.520
So I sold it.

29:31.240 --> 29:34.280
Why did you buy it back in early 2003?

29:35.280 --> 29:37.560
At the time, I was working
at an insurance company.

29:38.640 --> 29:41.120
I dealt with a lot
of real estate developers.

29:42.800 --> 29:46.120
They all said housing prices
in Weiyang were about to skyrocket.

29:47.160 --> 29:49.240
Even though Yuanlongli
had rumors about a cursed building,

29:49.840 --> 29:51.400
and prices there wouldn't rise much,

29:51.920 --> 29:53.080
the location was still excellent.

29:53.160 --> 29:55.000
If it couldn't be sold,

29:55.520 --> 29:56.960
the owners could always wait
for demolition compensation.

29:58.000 --> 29:59.160
Later, I worked hard

29:59.240 --> 30:01.040
to get into the demolition department
of a property company

30:01.680 --> 30:04.080
so I could get
a bigger share of the payout.

30:05.600 --> 30:07.560
Why did you buy it
under Yao Xincheng's name

30:08.160 --> 30:09.640
and leave it untransferred
for more than ten years?

30:10.160 --> 30:13.320
Back then, there were always rumors
in the building

30:14.520 --> 30:16.320
that I was being kept by some rich man.

30:17.000 --> 30:18.480
I had no way to explain it.

30:19.000 --> 30:20.960
If the apartment showed under my name,

30:22.160 --> 30:24.240
there'd be even less way to explain it.

30:25.600 --> 30:26.800
Qiao Suqing,

30:27.920 --> 30:29.560
your story is touching.

30:31.120 --> 30:33.920
But it has nothing to do with my question.

30:35.800 --> 30:37.680
I'll repeat myself.

30:46.040 --> 30:48.200
How did you kill Xu Meng and her father?

30:50.320 --> 30:51.320
Officer He,

30:51.840 --> 30:53.280
I already told you.

30:53.360 --> 30:55.040
Their deaths had nothing to do with me.

30:55.120 --> 30:56.840
Did you see them again

30:57.360 --> 30:58.880
after the Mount Wu accident?

31:03.800 --> 31:04.640
Yes.

31:06.440 --> 31:07.960
I saw Xu Meng.

31:11.880 --> 31:12.720
Scissors.

31:12.800 --> 31:13.720
-Drink.
-Come on.

31:13.800 --> 31:15.200
What are you waiting for? Drink.

31:16.520 --> 31:17.680
-Again.
-One more!

31:17.760 --> 31:20.240
-Rock, paper, scissors.
-Rock, paper, scissors.

31:20.760 --> 31:21.600
Drink.

31:30.120 --> 31:34.000
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

31:36.120 --> 31:37.520
Pretending not to know me?

31:44.160 --> 31:45.880
We're pretty fated

31:45.960 --> 31:47.840
to run into each other in Weiyang.

31:48.800 --> 31:50.560
I came here to visit a friend.

31:50.640 --> 31:51.840
I'm leaving tomorrow.

31:53.200 --> 31:54.320
Lend me some money.

31:56.840 --> 31:57.840
I have no money.

31:57.920 --> 31:59.080
No money?

32:06.640 --> 32:08.960
Did you forget who you are,

32:09.920 --> 32:11.240
murderer?

32:12.320 --> 32:15.000
You pushed your mom off the cliff.

32:16.560 --> 32:17.960
Do the police know that?

32:24.160 --> 32:25.200
Wait.

32:30.000 --> 32:32.000
You're not staying
at a friend's place, are you?

33:26.360 --> 33:27.600
Nice?

33:29.400 --> 33:30.240
This…

33:31.240 --> 33:32.600
This was a gift. You can't take it.

33:48.200 --> 33:49.040
Thanks.

34:02.040 --> 34:04.280
I had just crawled out of one living hell,

34:06.200 --> 34:08.159
only to be dragged into another.

34:11.639 --> 34:12.679
Xu Meng

34:13.440 --> 34:15.719
worked at Pattia on the 18th floor.

34:16.920 --> 34:19.880
She kept knocking on my door,
asking for money.

34:19.960 --> 34:21.600
In the spring of 1997,

34:23.400 --> 34:24.960
there was a crackdown
on prostitution at Pattia.

34:25.719 --> 34:27.760
I thought I had finally broken free.

34:29.480 --> 34:31.000
But instead, she came even more often,

34:31.760 --> 34:33.960
saying she owed loan sharks.

34:34.760 --> 34:36.600
I had no money to give her,

34:37.199 --> 34:40.280
so she started taking things from my home.

34:40.360 --> 34:41.600
Until…

34:42.679 --> 34:44.600
Until I met someone.

34:46.400 --> 34:47.679
To be precise,

34:51.639 --> 34:53.280
he wasn't even human.

34:59.440 --> 35:00.560
Hold on.

35:04.960 --> 35:06.120
Thank you.

35:20.840 --> 35:21.680
Miss,

35:22.520 --> 35:24.680
sell your stockings to me.

35:25.840 --> 35:27.440
Name any price you want.

35:31.080 --> 35:32.200
I can help you take them off.

35:34.520 --> 35:35.640
Don't come near me.

35:38.440 --> 35:40.800
-Come on.
-Don't come near me!

35:44.680 --> 35:46.480
Later, I found out

35:47.160 --> 35:48.360
Wu Shanlong

35:49.040 --> 35:51.800
was the brother-in-law
of a rich businessman, Song Qingsong.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.760
He lived on the 17th floor.

35:54.280 --> 35:55.400
From then on,

35:55.920 --> 35:57.280
I hid whenever I saw him.

35:58.160 --> 35:59.920
But what was bound to happen

36:00.640 --> 36:02.560
was impossible to escape.

36:05.200 --> 36:08.440
I heard someone

36:10.280 --> 36:11.840
has been following you lately, right?

36:13.240 --> 36:16.240
A girl from the foot massage shop.

36:16.760 --> 36:17.960
Her name is Mengmeng.

36:19.080 --> 36:20.480
I can help you take care of it.

36:21.000 --> 36:23.840
You only need to give me

36:23.920 --> 36:25.920
a little reward.

36:32.560 --> 36:33.800
Miss.

36:34.680 --> 36:37.120
Miss, once you've thought it through,

36:38.080 --> 36:39.800
come to me anytime.

36:41.920 --> 36:44.320
I knew what kind of man Wu Shanlong was.

36:45.800 --> 36:47.400
I didn't want to be
involved with him in any way.

36:48.880 --> 36:51.600
So I did nothing but stay hidden at home.

36:52.280 --> 36:53.880
A few days later,

36:53.960 --> 36:55.640
I heard

36:55.720 --> 36:58.880
Xu Meng and her father
had disappeared in the building.

37:08.200 --> 37:09.520
Eighteen pillars

37:09.600 --> 37:10.720
with 18 men to carry them.

37:10.800 --> 37:12.040
Eighteen bodies,

37:12.120 --> 37:13.240
18 heads.

37:13.320 --> 37:15.000
Pass this rhyme on to three people.

37:15.080 --> 37:17.840
Otherwise, calamity will befall you
within three days.

37:27.600 --> 37:28.560
What are you doing? Get out!

37:33.760 --> 37:34.520
Miss,

37:35.520 --> 37:36.920
Mengmeng and her dad

37:37.600 --> 37:38.520
are dead.

37:40.400 --> 37:41.480
I killed them.

37:43.800 --> 37:45.000
I lured them into my place

37:46.080 --> 37:46.960
and killed them both with one stab each.

37:52.560 --> 37:54.920
I've already taken care of your problem.

37:55.440 --> 37:56.640
Shouldn't you

37:57.440 --> 37:59.160
pay me back now?

38:03.480 --> 38:04.760
Whatever you did
has nothing to do with me.

38:04.840 --> 38:07.120
Get out of here,
or I'm calling the police.

38:07.640 --> 38:08.560
Go ahead.

38:09.160 --> 38:10.440
Call the police.

38:11.200 --> 38:13.240
About what Mengmeng told me
before she died,

38:13.320 --> 38:16.280
I'd like to speak with the police.

38:20.920 --> 38:21.760
Miss,

38:23.200 --> 38:25.720
what you did on Mount Wu,

38:26.720 --> 38:28.160
I know all about it.

39:07.560 --> 39:08.480
Come on.

39:09.880 --> 39:11.040
Give me a smile.

39:20.560 --> 39:21.960
From then on,

39:24.680 --> 39:26.800
Wu Shanlong kept coming,

39:28.760 --> 39:31.440
asking for

39:32.120 --> 39:32.960
worn underwear

39:33.600 --> 39:34.560
and stockings.

39:39.680 --> 39:41.160
It disgusted me,

39:41.240 --> 39:42.840
but I was too scared to fight back.

39:43.440 --> 39:45.400
I put up with it for four or five years.

39:45.480 --> 39:46.840
I never thought

39:47.680 --> 39:49.280
he would go even further.

39:55.240 --> 39:56.280
Miss,

39:56.800 --> 39:58.560
whatever you do at home,

39:58.640 --> 40:00.560
act natural like before.

40:01.080 --> 40:02.360
Don't avoid the camera

40:03.200 --> 40:05.480
or close the curtains.

40:05.560 --> 40:07.680
Not even when you sleep.

40:17.960 --> 40:18.920
Cheer up, miss.

40:22.880 --> 40:25.080
All I wanted was to crawl
out of the abyss,

40:25.600 --> 40:27.200
to see the light,

40:28.080 --> 40:29.440
and hold onto it.

40:34.360 --> 40:37.040
Someone always dragged me back down.

40:41.520 --> 40:42.760
During that time,

40:45.800 --> 40:48.600
I thought about killing myself
more than once.

40:50.520 --> 40:51.720
Later,

40:51.800 --> 40:53.280
Xu Zhihong's severed head

40:53.360 --> 40:55.520
was found on the rooftop.

40:57.400 --> 40:58.400
That's when I found out

41:01.560 --> 41:04.040
Wu Shanlong hadn't just killed
Xu Meng and her father,

41:05.800 --> 41:07.840
he had dismembered them too.

41:09.880 --> 41:12.080
I was so terrified,
I couldn't sleep for days.

41:12.160 --> 41:14.120
I was scared that one day,

41:14.200 --> 41:16.040
I would end up just like them.

41:16.840 --> 41:18.120
So I thought

41:18.720 --> 41:21.480
I had to break free
from Wu Shanlong's control.

41:22.080 --> 41:24.280
I had to make that murderer pay
for what he did.

41:25.600 --> 41:27.640
Wu Shanlong had a fetish.

41:27.720 --> 41:30.160
He stole clothes
from women in the building.

41:31.040 --> 41:32.640
So I went to a secondhand shop

41:33.240 --> 41:37.760
and found a pair of heels
the same style Xu Meng took from me.

41:37.840 --> 41:40.080
But they only had red.

41:41.040 --> 41:43.040
I had no friends in Weiyang,

41:43.880 --> 41:45.640
so I paid

41:45.720 --> 41:47.720
Yao Xincheng's driver

41:48.360 --> 41:50.000
to have them changed to blue.

42:13.400 --> 42:14.360
Those shoes,

42:15.240 --> 42:16.400
I want them too.

42:22.040 --> 42:23.560
I'm not taking them off in the hallway.

42:52.640 --> 42:55.800
Miss, you're a curious cat.

42:59.040 --> 43:00.400
I have something

43:01.000 --> 43:02.560
more wild.

43:05.800 --> 43:06.760
Want to see?

43:21.400 --> 43:22.240
Come on.

43:24.520 --> 43:25.520
Come on.

44:38.200 --> 44:39.360
I believe you know

44:41.600 --> 44:42.840
what happened after that.

44:44.160 --> 44:46.160
That's the whole truth.

44:47.120 --> 44:48.960
I did hate Xu Meng,

44:50.120 --> 44:52.040
but I didn't kill her or her father.

44:52.680 --> 44:53.520
Instead,

44:57.080 --> 44:58.400
I was a victim too.

45:01.160 --> 45:02.360
Your story is flawless.

45:06.920 --> 45:08.320
This whole explanation,

45:08.400 --> 45:10.520
you must've planned for years, didn't you?
